#: apps/core/views.py:88
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We save your natural teeth first: root canals, fillings, minimal-prep "
"veneers — implants only if a tooth can't be saved. 35+ years, ★ %(rating)s "
"on Google."
msgstr ""
"Wir erhalten zuerst Ihre eigenen Zähne: Wurzelbehandlung, Füllungen, "
"schonende Veneers — Implantate nur, wenn nichts mehr zu retten ist. 35+ "
"Jahre, ★ %(rating)s."

#: apps/core/views.py:111
#| msgid ""
